1112:496" class="[word-break:break-word] font-['Hanken_Grotesk'] font-normal leading-[1.5] relative shrink-0 text-[color:#0a0a0a] text-[length:22px] w-[930px]">The S extends from a recognisable mark into icons and digital expressions. Stitch brings typography, grids, colour and components into a shared system, connecting the brand’s personality with the practical demands of a retail product.</p></div></div></div><p data-node-id="1126:5174" class="[word-break:break-word] font-['Hanken_Grotesk'] font-normal leading-[1.6] relative shrink-0 text-[#4a4a4d] text-[length:14px] w-[1344px]">AI image study / Existing Workbench composition</p><div data-node-id="1126:5173" data-name="Media / Gold’s Gym / Motion and identity" class="bg-[#f2f2f2] h-[756px] overflow-clip relative shrink-0 w-[1344px]"><div data-node-id="I1126:5173;960:267" data-name="MEDIA / replace fill" class="absolute inset-0"><div class="absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden pointer-events-none"><img alt="Key moment / Branded composition" src="/assets/parity/1130-735-5f4f5.png" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="absolute h-[133.82%] left-[-24.44%] max-w-none top-[-29.21%] w-[131.03%]"></div></div></div></div></SourceComposition>
<section class="source-text source-copy project-section" style="--source-space:96px;--source-height:132px" data-source-section="1146:852"><div data-node-id="1112:497" data-name="RO / Work Detail / Copy Block / Desktop" class="content-stretch flex gap-[60px] items-start min-h-[132px] relative shrink-0 w-[1344px]"><div data-node-id="1112:493" data-name="Label" class="content-stretch flex flex-col items-start relative self-stretch shrink-0 w-[330px]"><p data-node-id="1112:494" class="[word-break:break-word] font-['Hanken_Grotesk'] font-bold font-bold leading-[1.6] relative shrink-0 text-[color:#0a0a0a] text-[length:12px] tracking-[0.96px] uppercase w-[300px]">FROM SCREENS TO SYSTEMS</p></div><div data-node-id="1112:495" data-name="Copy" class="content-stretch flex flex-col items-start relative self-stretch shrink-0 w-[954px]"><p data-node-id="1112:496" class="[word-break:break-word] font-['Hanken_Grotesk'] font-normal leading-[1.5] relative shrink-0 text-[color:#0a0a0a] text-[length:22px] w-[930px]">As the product evolved, individual decisions became repeatable patterns. The work connects brand expression with navigation, product information and the small interactions that make a shopping journey coherent.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="source-text source-copy project-section" style="--source-space:96px;--source-height:165px" data-source-section="1146:857"><div data-node-id="1112:497" data-name="RO / Work Detail / Copy Block / Desktop" class="content-stretch flex gap-[60px] items-start min-h-[165px] relative shrink-0 w-[1344px]"><div data-node-id="1112:493" data-name="Label" class="content-stretch flex flex-col items-start relative self-stretch shrink-0 w-[330px]"><p data-node-id="1112:494" class="[word-break:break-word] font-['Hanken_Grotesk'] font-bold font-bold leading-[1.6] relative shrink-0 text-[color:#0a0a0a] text-[length:12px] tracking-[0.96px] uppercase w-[300px]">REVISITING THE ARCHIVE</p></div><div data-node-id="1112:495" data-name="Copy" class="content-stretch flex flex-col items-start relative self-stretch shrink-0 w-[954px]"><p data-node-id="1112:496" class="[word-break:break-word] font-['Hanken_Grotesk'] font-normal leading-[1.5] relative shrink-0 text-[color:#0a0a0a] text-[length:22px] w-[930px]">Contemporary generative studies revisit the original interfaces and visual language. They sit alongside design artefacts as new interpretations of the work, rather than records of historical screens.</p></div></div></section>
